*)


(*"product_definition_schema.acyclic_product_definition_formation_relationship.__note"
The algorithm of the function is explained in annex E.2.
*)

(*"product_definition_schema.acyclic_product_definition_formation_relationship.__note"
This function is not used in this schema. It is defined here because other ISO 10303 integrated resources and application protocols that use the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition_formation_relationship,product_definition_formation_relationship>> entity include rules that use this function.
*)

(*"product_definition_schema.acyclic_product_definition_formation_relationship.relation"
