(*"product_definition_schema.categories_of_product"
The **categories_of_product** function returns the set of product category names associated with the argument. The function evaluates the bag of instances of <<express:product_definition_schema.product_category,product_category>> that are associated with the input <<express:product_definition_schema.product,product>> through an instance of <<express:product_definition_schema.product_related_product_category,product_related_product_category>>. The function returns the SET of STRING values stored in the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_category.name,name>> attribute of the instances of <<express:product_definition_schema.product_category,product_category>> in the bag.
*)


